2026-05-22 · Path B (layered scaffold)
  Reason: existing repo is static HTML only (no package.json); brief Path A
          formally excluded (npm run dev impossible). Brief Path B fits:
          "scaffold جديد على نفس stack الموقع، أعد استخدام أي مكوّن صالح".
  Affects: entire build approach.

2026-05-22 · Mirror igarden-web stack exactly
  Reason: brand consistency, identical tooling, zero learning curve for the
          team that maintains igarden.sa. Versions pinned to match
          igarden-web/package.json (Next 16.2.4, React 19.2.5, Tailwind v4).
  Affects: package.json, configs.

2026-05-22 · Local SQLite (better-sqlite3) instead of Supabase cloud
  Reason: brief explicitly allows "Supabase أو SQLite محلي إن لم يتوفّر".
          No Supabase CLI installed. Phase 4 requires offline laptop demo —
          SQLite is the simplest path. Schema mirrors Supabase shape so a
          migration is trivial (.sql file is reusable).
  Affects: data layer.

2026-05-22 · Preserve old index.html in _legacy/ (not deleted)
  Reason: conservative — old demo is design reference + git history.
  Affects: repo root.

2026-05-22 · Branch feat/smartos-demo-hardening from main
  Reason: brief §9 explicit.
  Affects: git.

2026-05-22 · No push, no deploy, no MQTT/GPIO/FastAPI until G2/G3/G4
  Reason: STOP-GATEs are non-negotiable per §10.
  Affects: all phases.

