2026-05-22 · Server Actions inline in server components (not REST API routes)
  Reason: simpler than route handlers, server-side enforcement is identical
          (decideAIAction / issueCommandAction wrap CommandSafetyError-throwing
          query helpers). Less boilerplate, fewer surfaces to lock down.
  Affects: src/lib/actions.ts; passed as props to client components.

2026-05-22 · No PDF library; use browser print + CSV
  Reason: works offline (no pdf-lib heavy dep), still produces a sharable
          IFA-aligned compliance report with the mandatory disclaimer footer.
  Affects: src/components/ComplianceExport.tsx.

2026-05-22 · AI recommendation evidence pre-baked (no model call)
  Reason: brief §7 forbids unexplained AI + requires confidence label +
          human approval. Pre-baked evidence is the most honest implementation
          for a demo — exact text the engineering team reviewed.
  Affects: data/seed.ts, src/lib/golden-flow.ts.

2026-05-22 · 4 personas: operator/manager/executive (role cookie)
  Reason: brief §4 phase 2.4 — same data, different surfaces. Cookie-based
          so SSR can read it; no client store needed.
  Affects: src/lib/role.ts, components/RoleSwitcher.tsx, site/[id]/page.tsx.

2026-05-22 · NetworkHealth profile is *static-but-plausible*, never "instant"
  Reason: brief §4 phase 3.7 — even in simulated mode, avoid implying
          impossible zero-latency sync. Per-site profile shows realistic
          MQTT/Modbus latency + jitter.
  Affects: src/components/NetworkHealth.tsx.

2026-05-22 · Phase 4 fallback: dev requires no internet beyond first install
  Reason: brief §4 phase 4.3 — laptop demo offline. SQLite is local.
          Fonts are Tajawal+Poppins via next/font (cached in .next after
          first build). next.config.ts has no remote image hosts.
  Affects: data layer + layout.

2026-05-22 · 3 local commits (split logically); NO PUSH per G3
  Reason: brief §9 + §10 — commits small and local; push requires G3 approval.
  Affects: git history on feat/smartos-demo-hardening.

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 SECOND SPRINT — Supabase migration (fix Vercel deploy)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

2026-05-22 · Switched from SQLite to Supabase Postgres
  Reason: SQLite is offline-first but doesn't survive Vercel serverless
          (read-only FS / per-deploy reset) — /ai prerender failed because
          the build-time DB was empty. Brief-2 mandates online deploy +
          future MQTT live-data path.
  Affects: data layer, all pages, deployment story.

2026-05-22 · اختير Pro لعزل البيانات الفيزيائي (قرار علي 22 مايو + G-DATA)
  Reason: Free tier capped at 2 active projects per admin; org had
          igarden-web + igarden-ai-council already. New project
          igarden-smartos-demo (ID: ewcmosjxbqtzmkzakojn) keeps demo
          seeds physically separated from CRM/leads. $10/mo.
  Affects: project topology, billing.

2026-05-22 · Postgres ENUM types instead of CHECK strings
  Reason: cleaner than SQLite-style CHECK(IN(...)); the type system
          rejects forbidden values at parse time, not just insert time.
          Same red lines, stronger enforcement: source_type ENUM,
          requires_human_approval CHECK(=true), reason/disclaimer NOT NULL.
  Affects: data/schema.sql → supabase migration.

2026-05-22 · RLS: anon SELECT only, service_role writes
  Reason: brief §3 — public-readable demo, server-only writes.
          The seed function (seed_demo_data) and all Server Actions go
          through service_role; the dashboard reads use anon via SSR.
  Affects: 12 tables, 12 policies, security model.

2026-05-22 · Atomic write paths via Postgres functions (RPC)
  Reason: Supabase JS has no transactions; the old SQLite version used
          db.transaction(). Moved issue/execute/trigger logic to plpgsql:
          issue_command_with_event · execute_command_with_event ·
          trigger_golden_flow · seed_demo_data. Atomicity matches the
          original; bonus: callable from any SQL client.
  Affects: src/lib/queries.ts, src/lib/golden-flow.ts.

2026-05-22 · Pure-SQL seed function instead of TS-only script
  Reason: TS seed script needs SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY locally; the
          Postgres seed_demo_data() function runs server-side via
          execute_sql — no secret leak through .env.local during demo
          setup. TS script (scripts/seed-supabase.ts) kept as backup
          for CI-driven re-seeds.
  Affects: scripts/seed-supabase.ts, migrations/seed function.

2026-05-22 · All 9 pages: export const dynamic = 'force-dynamic'
  Reason: root cause of /ai prerender error was static generation of
          server components that read DB. Forcing dynamic = no build-time
          DB access = build passes even with empty / inaccessible DB.
  Affects: all src/app/**/page.tsx.

2026-05-22 · Defensive EmptyDb fallback on every list-using page
  Reason: belt + suspenders. Even with dynamic rendering, a Supabase
          outage shouldn't crash the page — render a graceful empty state
          telling the operator to seed.
  Affects: src/components/EmptyDb.tsx + all pages.

2026-05-22 · Tests: unit (mock) + integration (env-gated, auto-skip)
  Reason: removing better-sqlite3 killed the old fixtures. Pure DB
          constraint tests are now structural (in the migration) —
          re-asserting them needs Postgres. Solution: unit tests with a
          mocked supabase client (always run) + integration tests that
          auto-skip when SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY isn't set.
          15 tests total, 11 pass without env, 4 run with env.
  Affects: tests/, vitest.config.ts.

2026-05-22 · Branch feat/supabase-migration off feat/smartos-demo-hardening
  Reason: clean isolation — the previous PR (#3) stays as the SQLite
          checkpoint; this is the deployable variant. Keeps history clean.
  Affects: git topology.

